        <mxCell id="api1" value="REST API  (HTTP / JSON)&#xa;GET /search-content?q=&amp;content_type=&amp;limit=&amp;offset=&amp;start_time=&amp;end_time=&amp;app_name=&#xa;GET /keyword-search?q=&amp;fuzzy_match=  |  GET /activity-summary  |  GET /list-meetings  |  GET /frame-context  |  GET /search-elements&#xa;GET /search-speakers  |  GET /health  |  GET /list-monitors  |  GET /list-audio-devices&#xa;POST /pipes  |  POST /pipes/{name}/run  |  POST /export-video  |  POST /update-memory  |  POST /update-speaker  |  POST /merge-speakers"
          style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;align=left;"
          vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="966" width="1060" height="84" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="api2" value="MCP サーバ (Model Context Protocol) — AIツールから直接呼び出し可能な 25+ ツール&#xa;search-content / activity-summary / keyword-search / frame-context / list-meetings / get-meeting&#xa;update-memory / update-speaker / merge-speakers / search-speakers / list-unnamed-speakers&#xa;list-pipes / create-pipe / run-pipe / pipe-logs / export-video / control-recording / send-notification&#xa;start-meeting / stop-meeting / add-tags  +  team-search (Enterprise: sk_ent_ トークン必須)"
